WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.859
For notes you write often, make a template
with the fields you need.

00:00:04.709 --> 00:00:07.979
Open Settings, then Notes, and Manage
Templates.

00:00:09.229 --> 00:00:11.350
Tap Create template and give it a name.

00:00:12.586 --> 00:00:14.079
We'll call this one Home visit.

00:00:14.929 --> 00:00:18.856
Name the first field Visit summary and
choose Long text as its format.

00:00:20.056 --> 00:00:23.875
Add another field for Follow-up needed,
with Yes or no as its format.

00:00:27.775 --> 00:00:30.868
You can make a field required if it must be
filled in before saving a note.

00:00:32.242 --> 00:00:34.150
Check the labels, then save the template.

00:00:35.410 --> 00:00:38.050
When you write a note, choose Home visit
from the template menu.

00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:40.996
Saving the template hasn't created a visit
note yet.
